#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "<strong>Everything is saved as you go.</strong> You can close this page and come back later with the link in your verification email."
msgstr "<strong>Awtomatikong nase-save ang lahat.</strong> Puwede mong isara ang page na ito at bumalik mamaya gamit ang link sa iyong verification email."

