#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "<strong>Submit by 11:59 PM on %(day)s</strong> (Philippine time)."
msgstr "<strong>Isumite bago mag-11:59 PM sa %(day)s</strong> (oras sa Pilipinas)."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "After that, unsubmitted applications can no longer be sent."
msgstr "Pagkatapos nito, hindi na maipapadala ang mga aplikasyong hindi pa naisusumite."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "Your application was not submitted yet."
msgstr "Hindi pa naisusumite ang iyong aplikasyon."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "Please fix these:"
msgstr "Pakiayos ang mga ito:"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "1. Your details"
msgstr "1. Ang iyong impormasyon"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "Email:"
msgstr "Email:"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "Verified"
msgstr "Na-verify"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "2. About your qualifications"
msgstr "2. Tungkol sa iyong mga kwalipikasyon"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_status_lookup.html
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Opsyonal"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "This is the rating your current or last government office gave you (for example an IPCR or SPMS rating). If you haven&rsquo;t worked in government, choose that you don&rsquo;t have one."
msgstr "Ito ang rating na ibinigay sa iyo ng kasalukuyan o huling opisina mo sa gobyerno (halimbawa, IPCR o SPMS rating). Kung hindi ka pa nagtrabaho sa gobyerno, piliin na wala kang rating."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "3. Your documents"
msgstr "3. Ang iyong mga dokumento"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "Add each document as a PDF, JPG or PNG (up to %(mb)s MB per file). A document with several pages? Add the pages one by one, or as several photos &mdash; we combine them into one file for the reviewers. Each file is saved the moment it finishes uploading."
msgstr "Idagdag ang bawat dokumento bilang PDF, JPG o PNG (hanggang %(mb)s MB bawat file). May ilang pahina ang dokumento? Idagdag ang mga pahina isa-isa, o bilang ilang litrato &mdash; pagsasamahin namin ang mga ito sa isang file para sa mga reviewer. Nase-save ang bawat file sa sandaling matapos itong ma-upload."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_application.html
msgid "<strong data-doc-ready>%(ready)s</strong> of <strong data-doc-total>%(total)s</strong> required documents ready"
msgstr "<strong data-doc-ready>%(ready)s</strong> sa <strong data-doc-total>%(total)s</strong> kailangang dokumento ang handa na"

