msgstr "Lahat ng Uri ng Posisyon"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_portal.html recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_receipt.html recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_status_lookup.html recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_vacancy_detail.html
