msgstr "Permanente (Plantilla)"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_portal.html recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_receipt.html recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_status_lookup.html recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_vacancy_detail.html recruitment/templates/recruitment/includes/branch_explainer.html recruitment/templates/recruitment/includes/job_card.html
