#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_portal.html
msgid "Recruitment portal notes"
msgstr "Mga paalala tungkol sa portal"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_portal.html
msgid "Official DOH&ndash;CHD CALABARZON portal"
msgstr "Opisyal na portal ng DOH&ndash;CHD CALABARZON"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_portal.html
msgid "RA 10173 Data Privacy compliant"
msgstr "Sumusunod sa RA 10173 (Data Privacy)"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_portal.html
msgid "Privacy &amp; Data Protection"
msgstr "Privacy &amp; Proteksyon ng Datos"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_portal.html
msgid "What we do with your information"
msgstr "Ano ang ginagawa namin sa iyong impormasyon"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_portal.html
msgid "We follow the Data Privacy Act of 2012 (R.A. 10173). What you submit is used only to process your application for this position &mdash; only the recruitment officers and selection board can see it, and we never share it with anyone else unless you allow us to in writing."
msgstr "Sinusunod namin ang Data Privacy Act of 2012 (R.A. 10173). Ang isusumite mo ay gagamitin lamang para iproseso ang iyong aplikasyon sa posisyong ito &mdash; ang mga recruitment officer at selection board lang ang makakakita nito, at hindi namin ito ibabahagi kaninuman maliban kung papayagan mo kami nang nakasulat."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_portal.html
msgid "You can ask to <strong>access</strong>, <strong>correct</strong>, or <strong>delete</strong> your information &mdash; or withdraw your consent &mdash; at any time by contacting the HRMPSB Secretariat / Data Protection Officer of DOH&ndash;CHD CALABARZON. We keep your information only for as long as recruitment requires, in line with R.A. 10173."
msgstr "Puwede mong hilingin na <strong>makita</strong>, <strong>itama</strong>, o <strong>burahin</strong> ang iyong impormasyon &mdash; o bawiin ang iyong pahintulot &mdash; anumang oras sa pamamagitan ng HRMPSB Secretariat / Data Protection Officer ng DOH&ndash;CHD CALABARZON. Itinatago lang namin ang iyong impormasyon hangga&rsquo;t kailangan sa recruitment, alinsunod sa R.A. 10173."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_portal.html
msgid "Showing 1 position"
msgstr "Ipinapakita ang 1 posisyon"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_portal.html
msgid "Showing {count} positions"
msgstr "Ipinapakita ang {count} posisyon"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_portal.html
