msgstr "(huwag ibahagi)"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_receipt.html
msgid "Use this code with your email to track your application online. Treat it like a password &mdash; don't share it."
msgstr "Gamitin ang code na ito kasama ng iyong email para i-track ang iyong aplikasyon online. Ituring itong parang password &mdash; huwag itong ibahagi."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_receipt.html
