msgstr "Kung ayaw mo nang maisaalang-alang para sa <strong>%(title)s</strong>, puwede kang humiling na mag-withdraw dito. Itatala ito ng opisina at i-e-email ka. Ang pag-withdraw ay hindi pagtanggi sa iyo, at puwede ka pa ring mag-apply sa ibang posisyon."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_status_lookup.html
msgid "Reason"
msgstr "Dahilan"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_status_lookup.html
msgid "I want to withdraw my application. I understand this can't be undone online."
msgstr "Gusto kong i-withdraw ang aking aplikasyon. Naiintindihan kong hindi na ito maibabalik online."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_status_lookup.html
msgid "Send my withdrawal request"
msgstr "Ipadala ang aking kahilingang mag-withdraw"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_status_lookup.html
msgid "Application details"
msgstr "Detalye ng aplikasyon"

