msgid "Email the HRMU"
msgstr "Mag-email sa HRMU"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_status_lookup.html
msgid "Have your case number ready. Never share your Tracking Code; staff will never ask for it."
msgstr "Ihanda ang iyong case number. Huwag kailanman ibahagi ang iyong Tracking Code; hindi ito kailanman hihingin ng staff."

