msgid "Qualifications"
msgstr "Mga Kwalipikasyon"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_vacancy_detail.html
msgid "Do you meet these? Tick each one that applies to you."
msgstr "Pasok ka ba sa mga ito? I-tick ang bawat isang naaangkop sa iyo."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_vacancy_detail.html
msgid "This is only for you; nothing here is sent. The recruitment team checks every application against these standards."
msgstr "Para sa iyo lang ito; walang ipinapadala mula rito. Sinusuri ng recruitment team ang bawat aplikasyon batay sa mga pamantayang ito."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_vacancy_detail.html
msgid "<strong>Eligibility</strong> means a Civil Service eligibility (for example, passing the Career Service exam) or a professional license from a board exam (for example, RA 1080 for nurses, CPAs and other professionals)."
msgstr "Ang <strong>Eligibility</strong> ay Civil Service eligibility (halimbawa, pagpasa sa Career Service exam) o lisensyang propesyonal mula sa board exam (halimbawa, RA 1080 para sa mga nurse, CPA at iba pang propesyonal)."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_vacancy_detail.html
