msgstr "Idagdag ang iyong mga dokumento &mdash; puwede ang litrato mula sa phone, at puwedeng idagdag nang isa-isa ang mga pahina ng dokumentong maraming pahina."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_vacancy_detail.html
msgid "Submit. You&rsquo;ll get a receipt and a tracking code right away."
msgstr "Isumite. Makakatanggap ka agad ng resibo at tracking code."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_vacancy_detail.html
msgid "<strong>You don&rsquo;t have to finish in one go.</strong> Everything is saved as you add it; the link in your verification email brings you back."
msgstr "<strong>Hindi mo kailangang tapusin nang isang upuan.</strong> Nase-save ang lahat habang nagdadagdag ka; ibabalik ka ng link sa iyong verification email."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/applicant_vacancy_detail.html
