msgstr "Naghahanap ng permanenteng posisyon? Ang mga bakanteng <strong>Plantilla</strong> ay regular na posisyon sa gobyerno na may Civil Service tenure at buong benepisyo ng gobyerno."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/includes/branch_explainer.html
msgid "You are applying for a <strong>Permanent (Plantilla)</strong> position &mdash; a regular government post with Civil Service tenure and full government benefits."
msgstr "Nag-a-apply ka para sa posisyong <strong>Permanente (Plantilla)</strong> &mdash; regular na posisyon sa gobyerno na may Civil Service tenure at buong benepisyo ng gobyerno."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/includes/branch_explainer.html
msgid "You are applying for a <strong>Contract of Service</strong> position &mdash; a time-bound engagement for specific work or projects, without Civil Service tenure."
msgstr "Nag-a-apply ka para sa posisyong <strong>Contract of Service</strong> &mdash; trabahong may takdang panahon para sa partikular na gawain o proyekto, walang Civil Service tenure."

